WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.500 --> 01:46.700
=Episode 15=

01:48.950 --> 01:50.200
Ever since Qi was born,

01:51.160 --> 01:52.430
we have always been

01:52.800 --> 01:54.710
avoiding her meeting with Zhu Yu.

01:55.470 --> 01:57.670
Now that they've reunited,

01:57.920 --> 01:59.990
I'm afraid
the situation will be unfavorable.

02:01.430 --> 02:02.480
It was my fault.

02:03.230 --> 02:04.480
I never thought

02:05.150 --> 02:09.120
that Lin Yuan would come
to Wuyan Village.

02:09.880 --> 02:11.430
The Sea of Clear Skies is also aware

02:11.480 --> 02:12.960
that we are collecting Dragon Crystals.

02:13.280 --> 02:14.800
They probably already guessed

02:14.800 --> 02:16.070
we'd use those crystals against them.

02:17.190 --> 02:18.480
That's not a problem.

02:19.750 --> 02:20.710
After all these years,

02:20.960 --> 02:23.750
haven't we always been beware of

02:23.870 --> 02:26.120
and testing each other?

02:26.870 --> 02:28.390
What I'm more worried about is

02:29.430 --> 02:32.360
that they might tell Yue Jinzhao

02:32.430 --> 02:33.320
about his origins.

02:35.640 --> 02:38.280
I believe Zhu Yu will keep her word

02:38.430 --> 02:41.000
before finding a safe method

02:41.520 --> 02:44.160
to rescue the Yu Clan.

02:44.280 --> 02:47.000
She will not tell Yue Jinzhao the truth.

02:47.120 --> 02:49.110
But Yue Jinzhao already knows

02:49.190 --> 02:51.680
that he resembles Bian Luohuan.

02:52.230 --> 02:55.190
Moreover, he can find us

02:55.320 --> 02:56.470
by following the Qiyuan Sect.

02:56.550 --> 02:57.760
We are not ready yet.

02:58.079 --> 02:59.400
Then we'll speed it up

02:59.550 --> 03:01.040
to deal with the Qiyuan Sect.

03:01.190 --> 03:02.470
After all, we have enough Qiyuan Orbs.

03:02.960 --> 03:04.280
Your wound hasn't healed yet.

03:04.400 --> 03:05.440
What are you doing here?

03:06.230 --> 03:07.470
It was my slip before,

03:07.590 --> 03:09.000
so Jinzhao knocked off my mask.

03:09.280 --> 03:10.110
I'm to blame.

03:10.790 --> 03:11.910
I will find a remedy for that.

03:12.040 --> 03:13.960
There's no use talking about it now.

03:15.470 --> 03:16.190
Not long ago,

03:17.079 --> 03:18.440
I just used the Zhengwu Alliance

03:19.110 --> 03:20.960
to eliminate the Jiangning branch
of the Qiyuan Sect.

03:21.110 --> 03:22.110
The sect leader is dead.

03:22.440 --> 03:24.680
I want to write to Gao Xiao about it

03:24.910 --> 03:26.360
and let him succeed as sect leader.

03:26.440 --> 03:27.680
I will be responsible

03:27.790 --> 03:29.590
for the affairs of the Qiyuan Sect.

03:30.040 --> 03:30.640
Xuwei,

03:31.110 --> 03:33.190
I've been in charge of the Qiyuan Sect.

03:35.079 --> 03:37.000
You continue
to watch over the Sea of Clear Skies.

03:37.230 --> 03:39.320
If Zhu Yu forcibly keeps Qi,

03:39.440 --> 03:41.190
we must step in and stop it.

03:53.640 --> 03:55.750
Don't overthink it.

03:56.360 --> 03:57.550
You are seriously injured.

03:57.950 --> 03:59.910
He hopes that you can rest well.

04:00.470 --> 04:01.080
Qingfei.

04:02.190 --> 04:03.550
I understand.

04:04.800 --> 04:05.600
He is afraid

04:07.360 --> 04:09.080
I will do things outside our plan again.

04:10.190 --> 04:10.830
Well,

04:11.950 --> 04:13.280
he is worried about you.

04:13.800 --> 04:15.030
I think he did the right thing.

04:29.720 --> 04:30.670
Ling Ye.

04:33.190 --> 04:35.240
Why is Zhu Yu called Ling Ye now?

04:59.030 --> 04:59.520
Qi.

05:00.670 --> 05:01.440
You're here.

05:03.440 --> 05:04.110
Zhu Yu.

05:04.830 --> 05:06.750
Does the Yu Clan have many spells?

05:07.550 --> 05:08.280
Yes.

05:09.360 --> 05:10.830
Can you teach me?

05:11.800 --> 05:13.000
You are my daughter.

05:13.390 --> 05:14.720
As long as you want to learn,

05:14.950 --> 05:16.470
I will certainly teach you all I know.

05:16.600 --> 05:17.110
Really?

05:19.280 --> 05:22.550
Can you teach me
how to lift the Husheng Spell?

05:23.910 --> 05:26.880
Jinzhao lost most of his memory
because of me.

05:27.110 --> 05:28.030
I feel very guilty.

05:30.390 --> 05:31.550
The Husheng Spell?

05:35.190 --> 05:38.030
It is a secret of the Yu Clan.

05:38.600 --> 05:39.750
So you are unwilling to teach me?

05:40.080 --> 05:40.880
Of course not.

05:42.080 --> 05:42.909
As long as you want,

05:43.800 --> 05:45.720
I can do anything for you.

05:47.670 --> 05:48.000
I...

05:48.110 --> 05:49.310
It is getting late.

05:49.550 --> 05:50.880
You should go to bed.

05:51.280 --> 05:52.470
I'll teach you

05:52.670 --> 05:54.310
another day, okay?

06:12.350 --> 06:13.160
What?

06:14.160 --> 06:15.630
Are you afraid I'll kill myself?

06:22.920 --> 06:24.440
Enjoy your wine

06:24.760 --> 06:26.230
to forget.

06:27.160 --> 06:28.920
Jinzhao, let's drink.

06:32.920 --> 06:33.280
Come on.

06:43.000 --> 06:45.790
Let's get drunk.

06:47.320 --> 06:47.790
Come on.

07:03.600 --> 07:05.320
Qi always likes water.

07:06.280 --> 07:07.630
I always say she's like a fish.

07:08.390 --> 07:10.000
Surprisingly, I was right.

07:11.830 --> 07:13.480
So she is Kun.

07:14.480 --> 07:16.720
Her thoughts are always different.

07:17.320 --> 07:19.200
Scales will grow on her body.

07:20.280 --> 07:22.600
Now it all makes sense.

07:24.070 --> 07:24.880
What about Kun?

07:25.950 --> 07:26.720
What about humans?

07:30.000 --> 07:30.510
Come on.

07:31.000 --> 07:33.720
A toast to Qi for finding her origins.

07:40.720 --> 07:42.950
Are you okay, Jinzhao?

07:43.720 --> 07:45.230
What could be wrong with me?

07:45.550 --> 07:47.390
Qi has found her origins.

07:47.670 --> 07:49.280
I'm so happy for her.

07:53.070 --> 07:56.350
Humans can be quite interesting.

07:56.600 --> 07:58.510
Obviously, you are pretending

07:59.550 --> 08:00.600
to smile.

08:04.320 --> 08:05.160
I'm pretty good.

08:05.720 --> 08:07.000
I'm not pretending.

08:07.760 --> 08:08.670
You are.

08:15.550 --> 08:16.550
Today we know

08:17.110 --> 08:18.760
Little Yue is a young lord
of the Yu Clan.

08:20.320 --> 08:22.320
Yet you're a guy without memories.

08:23.790 --> 08:25.440
You must feel sad.

08:29.070 --> 08:29.950
Indeed, I am.

08:31.550 --> 08:34.549
Are you blaming Little Yue?

08:34.950 --> 08:35.600
How could I?

08:38.200 --> 08:39.039
I am just sad.

08:40.350 --> 08:42.200
The one who's been
with Qi for three years.

08:44.550 --> 08:45.320
Is that me?

08:48.160 --> 08:49.440
Is it really Yue Jinzhao?

08:52.830 --> 08:54.550
The desire to be with Qi

08:55.830 --> 08:57.390
and protect her.

08:59.160 --> 09:01.280
Does it belong to Yue Jinzhao?

09:03.350 --> 09:05.160
Is Qi dependent on me

09:07.510 --> 09:09.600
because of Yue Jinzhao?

09:12.320 --> 09:15.320
Jinzhao, in my opinion,

09:16.320 --> 09:17.440
you're asking for

09:18.070 --> 09:19.760
needless worries.

09:21.830 --> 09:22.630
Yes.

09:25.280 --> 09:28.070
No past, and no memories.

09:29.920 --> 09:31.720
The only thing for sure

09:34.480 --> 09:36.720
in the past three years is
that I am Yue Jinzhao.

09:37.790 --> 09:38.510
But now,

09:40.230 --> 09:41.670
I can't even be sure of that anymore.

09:45.830 --> 09:46.830
Think positive.

09:48.550 --> 09:49.950
You've been looking for your past.

09:51.350 --> 09:53.720
Anyway, you've found it.

09:58.830 --> 09:59.390
Yes.

10:01.600 --> 10:02.350
You're right.

10:05.280 --> 10:06.760
Qi has finally found her family.

10:08.550 --> 10:09.920
I should be happy for her.

10:22.070 --> 10:22.630
Jinzhao.

10:23.950 --> 10:24.280
Jinzhao.

10:24.390 --> 10:25.040
And you.

10:26.280 --> 10:27.310
Since you like someone,

10:28.240 --> 10:30.360
you must let her know your feelings.

10:34.280 --> 10:35.510
I...

10:36.680 --> 10:38.510
I'll give it a try.

10:38.800 --> 10:39.390
I will.

11:18.040 --> 11:19.680
I made it again this time.

11:23.190 --> 11:24.040
Xian Qing.

11:30.680 --> 11:31.070
Come.

11:34.510 --> 11:34.950
Thank you.

11:35.070 --> 11:35.750
Feel better?

11:38.630 --> 11:39.120
Yes.

11:39.920 --> 11:41.830
I just need to get through this moment.

11:42.360 --> 11:42.830
Zhaoyan.

11:44.360 --> 11:45.600
Twins in your family die young.

11:46.390 --> 11:47.310
Do you know why?

11:52.480 --> 11:54.480
Could you please stop asking?

11:55.390 --> 11:56.800
I don't want to lie to you.

12:00.830 --> 12:01.510
Never mind.

12:03.070 --> 12:05.510
If you don't want to, then don't.

12:06.600 --> 12:09.430
Xian Qing, don't worry about me.

12:09.560 --> 12:11.800
I'm already used to it.

12:13.430 --> 12:14.990
But even if you don't love yourself,

12:16.070 --> 12:18.480
think about the people around you.

12:19.070 --> 12:20.280
They will feel bad.

12:21.120 --> 12:21.870
I won't let them know.

12:21.990 --> 12:22.870
But I know.

12:26.510 --> 12:27.280
It pains me.

12:33.390 --> 12:34.830
Xian Qing, you must be kidding.

12:45.360 --> 12:46.560
Miss Shuo Xuan.

12:47.390 --> 12:48.680
Where are you?

13:00.480 --> 13:02.720
Shuo...

13:04.390 --> 13:06.160
Maybe next time.

13:06.920 --> 13:07.990
(Since you like someone,)

13:08.920 --> 13:11.040
(you must let her know your feelings.)

13:32.830 --> 13:33.800
Miss Shuo Xuan.

13:36.630 --> 13:37.630
Why is it you again?

13:37.800 --> 13:38.720
Why do you follow me?

13:40.880 --> 13:41.710
I...

13:45.600 --> 13:47.510
Well...

13:48.720 --> 13:49.160
I...

13:51.120 --> 13:51.920
I...

13:53.920 --> 13:56.560
Well...

13:56.680 --> 13:57.390
You like me?

14:00.190 --> 14:01.560
Well,

14:01.560 --> 14:03.720
I just came from over there

14:04.720 --> 14:05.390
and saw you.

14:05.390 --> 14:08.070
We admire heroes and warriors.

14:08.750 --> 14:11.950
You're a coward
who can't even defeat me.

14:17.360 --> 14:19.120
I have already become stronger

14:19.190 --> 14:20.870
than before.

14:22.870 --> 14:23.510
Alright then.

14:24.190 --> 14:25.280
Let's have a fight.

14:25.870 --> 14:26.870
If you win,

14:27.160 --> 14:28.240
I'll allow you to fall for me.

14:28.750 --> 14:30.160
But if you lose,

14:30.600 --> 14:32.950
you will be out of my sight.

14:35.720 --> 14:36.390
Well...

14:36.560 --> 14:37.240
Fight or not?

14:40.750 --> 14:41.190
Yes.

14:42.280 --> 14:42.950
Zhaoyan.

14:45.750 --> 14:46.750
Do you really not know?

14:48.120 --> 14:49.360
Or are you pretending not to know?

14:55.430 --> 14:57.630
Do you know what you are talking about?

15:06.750 --> 15:07.360
I do.

15:08.480 --> 15:09.830
You said that we are friends.

15:10.190 --> 15:11.920
But I don't want us to be just friends.

15:15.040 --> 15:16.800
I also don't just want
to be your confidant.

15:17.360 --> 15:18.600
The hairpin I gave you represents

15:20.120 --> 15:21.070
my feelings for you.

15:22.190 --> 15:23.680
You have feelings for me too.

15:24.560 --> 15:25.990
So why do you keep avoiding it?

15:34.280 --> 15:35.950
I am a human with a short life.

15:36.070 --> 15:37.480
I don't care about it.

15:38.870 --> 15:39.560
Just tell me.

15:40.990 --> 15:42.510
Are you willing to be with me?

15:44.200 --> 15:45.800
♪The sorrowful wind♪

15:45.800 --> 15:47.920
♪And the falling snow♪

15:48.430 --> 15:53.530
♪Can't bear to see your tears♪

15:55.470 --> 15:59.310
♪I can't be without you♪

15:59.820 --> 16:04.400
♪Take away my frail life♪

16:08.430 --> 16:09.830
Miss Luo might be looking for you.

16:12.160 --> 16:12.750
Sorry.

16:13.430 --> 16:13.920
It's alright.

16:15.750 --> 16:16.600
You should rest well.

16:17.810 --> 16:19.820
♪With the lightest whisper♪

16:19.820 --> 16:22.060
♪You make the harshest decision♪

16:22.060 --> 16:27.360
♪It's not different
from the extreme penalty♪

16:27.360 --> 16:30.680
Zhaoyan, I will wait for an answer.

16:31.340 --> 16:36.060
♪If it's all fate♪

16:36.880 --> 16:42.060
♪Don't question who has betrayed love♪

16:42.520 --> 16:45.130
♪If there's no hope for a reunion♪

16:45.130 --> 16:49.100
♪Don't eavesdrop on me in the dream♪

16:49.100 --> 16:53.510
♪Singing my yearning♪

16:56.360 --> 17:00.880
♪In the dream♪

17:03.120 --> 17:06.700
♪Singing my yearning♪

17:14.630 --> 17:15.280
You lost.

17:16.630 --> 17:17.069
I...

17:18.240 --> 17:21.119
I'm not strong enough now.

17:21.920 --> 17:23.430
But I will become stronger eventually.

17:23.920 --> 17:24.950
One day,

17:24.950 --> 17:27.119
I will become a great hero.

17:28.190 --> 17:30.280
So...

17:31.600 --> 17:33.430
- So now...
- You are also quite interesting.

17:36.240 --> 17:37.360
Miss Shuo Xuan.

17:37.600 --> 17:38.750
What do you like?

17:38.870 --> 17:40.280
The Sea of Clear Skies and Her Lordship.

17:42.240 --> 17:43.920
Are they the same?

17:44.360 --> 17:46.070
Her Lordship is the Sea of Clear Skies.

17:46.190 --> 17:47.950
The Sea of Clear Skies is Her Lordship.

17:49.630 --> 17:51.480
Do you like anything else?

17:53.800 --> 17:54.600
I also like little fish.

17:57.160 --> 17:58.630
I like fish too.

17:58.870 --> 17:59.510
I mean it.

17:59.680 --> 18:01.310
It tastes good to be baked or fried.

18:03.070 --> 18:03.800
Get lost.

18:08.870 --> 18:09.680
Sorry.

18:09.680 --> 18:10.600
Miss Shuo Xuan.

18:10.600 --> 18:11.830
That's not what I meant.

18:11.830 --> 18:12.830
I'm sorry, Miss Shuo Xuan.

18:13.070 --> 18:14.920
I...

18:18.560 --> 18:19.870
I messed it up again.

18:22.560 --> 18:23.370
Zhaoyan.

18:24.680 --> 18:26.560
Take care of yourself.

18:27.630 --> 18:29.070
Maiming, you too.

18:44.800 --> 18:49.710
The Sea of Clear Skies
and the young lord of the Yu Clan.

18:51.040 --> 18:55.040
The young lord of the Yu Clan

18:55.870 --> 18:57.990
could be Bian Luohuan's disciple.

18:59.200 --> 18:59.870
Cang Feng.

19:00.990 --> 19:03.560
Things are getting more interesting.

19:04.520 --> 19:06.110
You love the fun.

19:07.200 --> 19:08.800
I've been staying in my room for long.

19:09.510 --> 19:12.440
Now the time is right.

19:13.920 --> 19:16.510
Since Yue Qi is Kun,

19:17.110 --> 19:19.470
it makes sense

19:19.630 --> 19:22.280
that why she could
cause the Rehai key ring to react.

19:23.280 --> 19:23.750
Why?

19:27.150 --> 19:31.160
The key rings are made
from divine objects.

19:31.710 --> 19:34.710
The power of Nine Springs
resonates with each other.

19:38.040 --> 19:41.390
The Rehai key ring is made
from a dragon's horn.

19:42.390 --> 19:46.920
The Mist Soul key ring is made
from the scales of Kun.

19:47.470 --> 19:52.680
So, if Yue Qi can cause Rehai to react,

19:54.870 --> 19:56.560
it's not surprising at all.

19:56.710 --> 19:57.280
I see.

20:05.280 --> 20:14.870
Zhaoyan is really having a good time.

20:29.870 --> 20:32.280
The colorful world makes her get lost.

20:34.750 --> 20:40.080
The young girl has finally grown up.

20:51.840 --> 20:53.800
Zhu Yu, as we agreed yesterday,

20:53.960 --> 20:54.870
shouldn't you teach me

20:54.990 --> 20:57.110
how to undo the Husheng Spell?

20:59.350 --> 21:00.110
No.

21:00.630 --> 21:02.280
The moment I mentioned it yesterday,

21:02.390 --> 21:03.870
Zhu Yu tried to avoid it.

21:04.870 --> 21:06.470
What should I do?

21:09.870 --> 21:11.320
Why is Jinzhao here?

21:11.590 --> 21:13.710
You want Qi to stay
in the Sea of Clear Skies?

21:14.590 --> 21:16.080
Qi has wandered with me for three years.

21:16.870 --> 21:17.920
She has suffered a lot.

21:18.710 --> 21:20.710
She deserves to return to her world.

21:23.630 --> 21:25.590
But you can't decide for her.

21:25.990 --> 21:27.590
Actually, I have thought
about taking Qi away.

21:29.510 --> 21:31.680
But she has found her family.

21:33.080 --> 21:33.960
Everyone here

21:34.800 --> 21:36.960
will respect and care for her.

21:38.350 --> 21:39.590
I can't take away everything

21:40.870 --> 21:42.510
that belongs to her
because of my selfishness.

21:43.800 --> 21:45.200
But she is willing to go with you.

21:46.110 --> 21:47.750
You are the most important to her.

21:48.960 --> 21:51.200
I taught Qi everything I know.

21:51.920 --> 21:53.710
The reason she wants to go with me

21:54.920 --> 21:57.160
is that I was the only one she had
in the past three years.

21:58.960 --> 21:59.990
It's not like that.

22:05.040 --> 22:06.470
You are determined to leave

22:09.560 --> 22:11.390
because of the Husheng Spell.

22:22.510 --> 22:23.710
(Qi is using the Resonance Spell.)

22:44.590 --> 22:45.110
(Qi.)

23:16.920 --> 23:17.440
Qi!

23:20.870 --> 23:21.510
Qi!

23:37.630 --> 23:38.390
Qi.

23:40.330 --> 23:43.470
Jinzhao, I don't want the Husheng Spell.

23:43.680 --> 23:44.970
Neither do you.

23:54.750 --> 23:56.680
Jinzhao!

23:57.080 --> 23:57.630
Qi.

24:05.680 --> 24:08.170
♪The butterfly
flies near the fingertips♪

24:08.750 --> 24:11.590
♪Unnoticed by anyone♪

24:14.110 --> 24:16.800
Jinzhao, I don't want this.

24:16.960 --> 24:17.590
Qi.

24:17.680 --> 24:20.080
I don't want this.

24:25.470 --> 24:26.040
Qi.

24:27.820 --> 24:31.650
♪Cannot give up emotional attachments♪

24:32.330 --> 24:35.530
♪In this lifetime, you are my obsession♪

24:37.710 --> 24:38.710
Why did you do this?

24:40.970 --> 24:45.360
♪Fearful of the changing world♪

24:45.360 --> 24:49.680
♪Fearful of not having
the chance to bid you farewell♪

24:49.680 --> 24:53.930
♪Fearful that my memories
will only be filled with longing♪

24:55.560 --> 24:56.390
Jinzhao.

24:59.020 --> 25:03.360
♪Fearful of dreaming of you and parting♪

25:03.360 --> 25:05.560
Are you going to abandon me?

25:07.630 --> 25:12.110
♪Fearful that it will be
an eternal parting♪

25:12.110 --> 25:16.200
♪Fearful of going through reincarnation
and searching through the world♪

25:16.200 --> 25:18.890
♪Only to brush past each other♪

25:45.590 --> 25:46.390
Jinzhao.

25:48.800 --> 25:50.840
Do you really want to leave me here?

25:55.840 --> 25:58.160
Qi, do you remember?

25:59.110 --> 26:00.920
When we were at Jing'an, you asked me

26:01.990 --> 26:02.920
about your mother.

26:05.750 --> 26:07.470
I know your longing for a mother.

26:09.280 --> 26:12.840
So whether I'm by your side,

26:13.920 --> 26:15.040
I cannot replace

26:16.280 --> 26:18.040
your mother Zhu Yu.

26:21.630 --> 26:23.630
But I don't want
to be separated from you.

26:36.920 --> 26:39.200
In the beginning,
you may not be used to it.

26:40.040 --> 26:42.440
But gradually, you will.

26:45.390 --> 26:47.280
How could I?

26:47.990 --> 26:48.630
You will.

26:49.710 --> 26:51.390
Just like the jade pendant
that you used to have

26:52.440 --> 26:53.920
can be dropped inadvertently.

27:00.960 --> 27:02.280
Jinzhao, wait here for me.

27:02.510 --> 27:04.080
I'll go retrieve the jade pendant.

27:04.320 --> 27:04.870
Wait for me.

27:10.560 --> 27:12.840
Miss Yue is innocent,
but she's not foolish.

27:13.470 --> 27:14.960
One day she'll understand

27:15.590 --> 27:16.960
that in her world,

27:17.080 --> 27:18.440
it's not just the two of you.

27:18.800 --> 27:21.200
Overprotection is inappropriate.

27:22.750 --> 27:23.590
(Goodbye.)

27:24.870 --> 27:25.350
(Qi.)

27:44.200 --> 27:45.200
Where is it?

28:05.320 --> 28:06.230
Finally found it.

28:20.920 --> 28:22.040
Yue Jinzhao has left.

28:25.590 --> 28:27.390
He left by the Yunlai Stone.

28:38.390 --> 28:40.200
This is what he left behind.

28:46.440 --> 28:47.320
Inside this,

28:49.680 --> 28:51.920
I've written about some things Qi likes.

28:53.200 --> 28:55.920
It's what I've learned
by taking care of her

28:56.040 --> 28:57.560
in the past three years.

29:08.390 --> 29:09.290
Rest assured,

29:10.870 --> 29:15.230
I will take care of Qi,
just like you did.

29:37.960 --> 29:39.110
(Qi loves food.)

29:40.040 --> 29:41.200
(She is not a picky eater.)

29:43.280 --> 29:44.800
(Her favorite is egg noodles)

29:45.390 --> 29:46.920
(and pastries in Jing'an.)

29:47.040 --> 29:48.510
As we mentioned last time...

29:49.320 --> 29:50.960
(She likes storytelling
and reading storybooks.)

29:52.110 --> 29:54.510
(She loves to hear tales and anecdotes.)

29:55.710 --> 29:57.710
(Whenever she encounters a storyteller,)

29:58.280 --> 29:59.510
(she will listen carefully.)

29:59.960 --> 30:01.560
A shock through the heavens.

30:01.920 --> 30:03.160
Lightning flashes and thunder roars.

30:03.590 --> 30:05.440
That life breaks free from its shackles

30:05.560 --> 30:07.440
and soars into the sky.

30:07.800 --> 30:13.110
And a legend unfolds.

30:14.920 --> 30:16.280
(Apart from good food,)

30:17.080 --> 30:20.080
(she is not particular
about clothes or accommodations.)

30:21.200 --> 30:23.680
(However, she will have a better life
in the future.)

30:24.780 --> 30:29.320
♪We are like being
at the two ends of the outcome♪

30:30.410 --> 30:33.100
♪Separated by a sea♪

30:35.080 --> 30:37.510
(Qi is very clever,)

30:39.160 --> 30:41.870
(but sometimes she is a bit slow
in human relations.)

30:42.920 --> 30:44.080
(She needs to be taught slowly.)

30:44.940 --> 30:49.850
♪I watch time reverse and grow distant♪

30:49.850 --> 30:53.000
♪And dialogues get unfamiliar♪

30:54.160 --> 30:54.800
(Also,)

30:55.870 --> 30:57.200
(Qi is a young lord,)

30:58.590 --> 31:00.390
(but don't impose many rules
and restrictions on her.)

31:01.710 --> 31:02.590
(She does not like that.)

31:03.750 --> 31:06.160
(What she needs is a carefree life.)

31:06.320 --> 31:11.160
♪I can't walk out of the memories.
The longing is hard to endure♪

31:11.160 --> 31:13.320
♪Yet you are not here♪

31:13.320 --> 31:18.120
♪I watch time reverse and grow distant♪

31:18.120 --> 31:21.320
♪And dialogues get unfamiliar♪

31:21.320 --> 31:26.960
♪If time could pause for me
at the crossroads of parting♪

31:26.960 --> 31:29.280
(Jinzhao, I must find the way)

31:29.440 --> 31:31.040
(to lift the Husheng Spell.)

31:34.090 --> 31:40.650
♪This time I'll turn back first♪

31:52.040 --> 31:52.990
Little Yue is not with you.

31:53.870 --> 31:55.080
What are you planning to do next?

31:58.990 --> 32:00.870
Now that Qi has found her family,

32:01.350 --> 32:02.560
I need to find mine.

32:03.630 --> 32:05.560
I need to find Bian Luohuan.

32:06.280 --> 32:07.990
I want to find out my origins

32:08.470 --> 32:09.710
and eradicate the Qiyuan Sect

32:10.110 --> 32:10.840
to prevent them...

32:27.320 --> 32:28.080
Footprints here.

32:33.200 --> 32:34.920
What's wrong, Jinzhao?

32:39.920 --> 32:40.510
Nothing.

32:41.920 --> 32:43.040
I suddenly thought of one thing.

32:44.110 --> 32:45.840
Since we encountered
Gao Xiao's demon beast

32:46.200 --> 32:47.800
by the Yinma River,

32:48.870 --> 32:50.110
the stronghold of the Qiyuan Sect

32:50.230 --> 32:51.470
might be nearby.

32:52.510 --> 32:53.040
It makes sense.

32:54.080 --> 32:55.280
If we want to eradicate Qiyuan Sect,

32:55.440 --> 32:57.110
we may have to cooperate
with the Zhengwu Alliance.

32:57.470 --> 32:59.630
But we've already fallen out with them.

33:03.160 --> 33:04.040
I don't have to go.

33:05.320 --> 33:05.920
Xian Qing.

33:07.230 --> 33:09.040
Xian Qing, are you still mad

33:09.390 --> 33:11.200
at Zuo Guanren?

33:13.470 --> 33:14.750
I don't care about that

33:15.040 --> 33:16.710
at all.

33:17.680 --> 33:19.040
I have lived for over a thousand years,

33:19.350 --> 33:21.710
while Zuo Guanren is barely over fifty.

33:22.200 --> 33:23.320
How could I possibly quibble

33:23.470 --> 33:25.200
with my junior over such trivialities?

33:27.040 --> 33:28.960
And I've lived as I please
for a thousand years.

33:29.390 --> 33:30.680
I've traveled a lot with you.

33:32.440 --> 33:33.110
And now I am tired.

33:35.870 --> 33:38.390
You can go back to Mount Yuqing, Uncle.

33:40.630 --> 33:42.750
Will you come back and join us again?

35:12.920 --> 35:14.110
Did you follow me

35:14.840 --> 35:16.200
because you have something to tell me?

35:18.350 --> 35:19.470
I know

35:19.470 --> 35:20.440
you left

35:20.560 --> 35:22.710
to facilitate the cooperation
with the Zhengwu Alliance.

35:25.350 --> 35:25.990
You know me best.

35:26.960 --> 35:27.660
However,

35:29.160 --> 35:31.160
I thought you came to give me an answer.

35:35.160 --> 35:35.630
I...

35:37.560 --> 35:38.110
I...

35:45.280 --> 35:47.920
Never mind. I have a journey ahead.

35:48.800 --> 35:49.510
Farewell.

35:57.950 --> 35:59.120
I want...

35:59.560 --> 36:00.590
I...

36:07.280 --> 36:07.880
What do you want?

36:08.430 --> 36:10.040
I want...

36:13.430 --> 36:14.910
I want you to join us again.

36:15.040 --> 36:16.080
I also want to be with you.

36:21.150 --> 36:21.880
Farewell.

36:41.990 --> 36:42.670
Farewell.

37:47.670 --> 37:48.230
Your Lordship.

37:49.560 --> 37:50.430
How is the young lord?

37:52.840 --> 37:54.230
Qi is fine.

37:56.510 --> 37:57.320
But just now,

37:59.280 --> 38:00.880
I saw her cry.

38:02.800 --> 38:03.320
Cry?

38:05.510 --> 38:07.230
She is your child.

38:09.080 --> 38:10.150
How could Kun cry?

38:11.190 --> 38:15.080
Right, how could Kun cry?

38:17.120 --> 38:18.510
I am still Kun.

38:20.230 --> 38:24.040
But my daughter is becoming more
like a human.

38:26.800 --> 38:28.840
She has traveled
in the Mortal Realm for too long.

38:29.710 --> 38:30.840
She's been assimilated by humans.

38:31.910 --> 38:33.120
This can't go on anymore.

38:33.990 --> 38:36.600
Your Lordship,
why not take this opportunity

38:36.880 --> 38:38.640
to keep the young lord by your side

38:38.750 --> 38:39.800
in the Sea of Clear Skies?

38:40.430 --> 38:41.150
Absolutely not.

38:44.230 --> 38:44.880
Your Lordship.

38:47.040 --> 38:49.400
If the young lord stays for a long time,

38:49.710 --> 38:52.360
I fear it will break our agreement
with the Hengdao Sect.

38:54.150 --> 38:55.840
At worst, we'll fall out with them.

38:57.040 --> 38:58.320
It's not yet the time.

39:06.800 --> 39:07.430
Your Lordship.

39:08.430 --> 39:09.190
One more thing.

39:10.230 --> 39:12.560
The Hengdao Sect
is mining Dragon Crystals.

39:12.710 --> 39:15.400
And Dragon Crystals can be used
as energy for mechanisms.

39:16.190 --> 39:18.880
I fear that they may be used
against our people in the future.

39:20.910 --> 39:21.880
It's not a concern.

39:23.800 --> 39:28.430
The most important thing now is
to find Rehai.

39:28.600 --> 39:29.190
Yes.

39:30.670 --> 39:32.560
With the life force of Rehai,

39:32.990 --> 39:36.640
Your Lordship can heal us soon.

40:16.960 --> 40:20.640
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

40:21.980 --> 40:24.550
♪Burns what once was♪

40:26.080 --> 40:28.910
♪The name is forgotten♪

40:32.990 --> 40:36.510
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

40:37.920 --> 40:40.950
♪Only through the eyes♪

40:41.820 --> 40:44.870
♪Who can see them clearly♪

40:47.040 --> 40:53.080
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

40:54.790 --> 41:01.150
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

41:03.010 --> 41:10.500
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

41:11.050 --> 41:17.530
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

41:34.980 --> 41:38.960
♪The seemingly random paths♪

41:40.000 --> 41:42.860
♪The burning traces♪

41:43.940 --> 41:47.900
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

41:51.040 --> 41:55.330
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

41:55.970 --> 41:59.250
♪Are all carefully♪

42:00.030 --> 42:03.490
♪Arranged by me♪

42:04.960 --> 42:11.900
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

42:12.960 --> 42:19.940
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

42:20.960 --> 42:28.540
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

42:29.060 --> 42:36.220
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

42:36.700 --> 42:44.490
♪I'm destined to give my all for you♪

42:44.960 --> 42:52.510
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

42:52.900 --> 43:00.980
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

43:00.980 --> 43:09.120
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪
